  "description": "Opt-in TestContainers fixtures for testing Excalibur infrastructure implementations against real backends (SQL Server, PostgreSQL, Redis, RabbitMQ, Cosmos DB emulator) via Docker. Kept as a separate package so the core conformance toolkit (Excalibur.Testing.Conformance) never forces a Docker/TestContainers dependency. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
